Package: miadi-chronicle-client
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: miadi-node (>= 24.21.0-1), miadi-node (<< 25)
Recommends: miadi-config (>= 0.2.0)
Maintainer: Miadi <mia@jgwill.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/jgwill/miadi-orchestration-kit
Description: The Miadi chronicle's commands and MCP servers, for agents and people
 The client half: what a machine runs to read, relate and write the Miadi
 chronicle through its API. Pinned npm releases, run by miadi-node:
  inquiry-weave, inquiry-weave-mcp   @miadi/inquiry-weave (episodes, relations)
  passages, mkepisode                passages (episode vessels)
  miadi-voice-mcp                    @miadi/voice-mcp
  medicine-wheel-mcp                 @medicine-wheel/mcp (the chronicle wheel)
 /usr/share/miadi-chronicle-client/SOURCE lists every version installed.
